Description: Hide Privacy & Security's Telemetry page
 Its switches send error reports and system information to Canonical,
 which Patrone does not (patrone-desktop removes whoopsie, ubuntu-insights
 and ubuntu-report), so the page would offer settings that do nothing.
Author: William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/panels/privacy/cc-privacy-panel.blp
+++ b/panels/privacy/cc-privacy-panel.blp
@@ -49,7 +49,8 @@
             show-arrow: true;
             action-name: "navigation.push";
             action-target: "'telemetry'";
-            visible: bind telemetry_page.visible;
+            // Patrone sends nothing to Canonical: no Telemetry page
+            visible: false;
           }
 
           $CcListRow {
